                "text": "During my visit to a La Clinica de Familia in Chaparral, I accepted the push-up challenge with a 79-year-old cancer survivor. \ud83d\udcaa \n\nFunding for federally qualified healthcare centers, such as LCDF, will continue to provide quality health care in the colonias. https://t.co/L7Mxmt1AlQ",
