                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I'm voting NO on the Republican budget resolution, which seeks to increase your health care costs, eliminate medicaid coverage, and eliminate food assistance programs for New Mexicans. This is at the same time Republicans are trying to give away your tax payer dollars to rich millionaires and billionaires.",
