                "text": "Today, Senate Republicans passed the Big Ugly Bill: the largest TAX CUTS FOR THE WEALTHY and the BIGGEST CUTS TO HEALTHCARE AND FOOD ASSISTANCE in history. Folks, if Republicans pass this bill in the House, our lives will change forever, leaving our children with massive debt, no access to doctors, and with record inflation. This NASTY BILL IS A MESS, and millionaires like Donald Trump are laughing all the way to the bank.",
