                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I visited Carlsbad Medical Center\u2014a rural hospital at risk of having to cut services or close its doors due to Republicans\u2019 devastating Medicaid cuts. I met with hospital leaders to discuss its critical role in our community. Without CMC, kids would miss their yearly check ups, expectant mothers would go without critical prenatal support, and seniors would lose access to long-term care.",
